     1866   define temp-table wt-bar-code no-undo like ub.bar-code.
     1867   PROCEDURE proc-load-bar-code:
     1868     define input parameter p-imp-handle as handle  no-undo.
     1869     define input parameter p-pck-num    as integer no-undo.
     1870     define input parameter l-counter    as integer no-undo.
     1871     do
