     7869   end.
     7870   for each locb-c-inkas-pay-wth
     7871   on error  undo, return error
     7872   :
     7873     delete locb-c-inkas-pay-wth.
     7874   end.
     7875   for each locb-sale-doc
     7876   on error  undo, return error
     7877   :
