     7890   for each locb-chk-gds
     7891   on error  undo, return error
     7892   :
     7893     delete locb-chk-gds.
     7894   end.
     7895   for each locb-chk-gds-attr
     7896   on error  undo, return error
     7897   :
     7898     delete locb-chk-gds-attr.
     7899   end.
     7900   for each locb-chk-pay
     7901   on error  undo, return error
     7902   :
     7903     delete locb-chk-pay.
     7904   end.
     7905   for each locb-chk-pay-attr
