    10108   define temp-table locb-ord-dtl       no-undo like ub.ord-dtl.
    10109   define temp-table wt-ord-doc no-undo like ub.ord-doc.
    10110   PROCEDURE proc-load-ord-doc:
    10111     define input parameter p-imp-handle as handle  no-undo.
