    16729   :
    16730     delete locb-marking-lines.
    16731   end.
    16732       delete wt-trn-doc.
    16733     end.
    16734   END PROCEDURE.
    16735   define temp-table locb-c-doc-line      no-undo like ub.c-doc-line.
